  "h3s": [
    "Valley Bakery, a locally-sourced Burnaby bakery since 1957, has been a beloved part of the Lower Mainland for over six decades. Our customers know us for our dedication to crafting delicious European-style baked goods, including exquisite wedding cakes, delightful buttercream treats, artisanal breads, and savoury meat pies."
  ],
